WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:01.710
Wow!

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.810
I've never seen anything like this!

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.020
This is an entertainment duel?

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:07.990
As of today, stop fighting 
duels that hurt people?

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:11.960
This turn, I destroy all Special 
Summoned monsters!

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:20.570
Come on, BB. You're the one 
who can ultimately finish it.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:25.140
Through Great Fortress's effect,

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:31.780
for every monster sent to the graveyard, 
I take 500 points of damage!

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.260
Having won the duel with BB,

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:42.050
I left Gongenzaka and the others behind

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:44.870
in the underground 
training facility.

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:51.120
Surely, Yuzu, kidnapped by Serena, 
was somewhere in Academia.

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.120
But where?

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.040
The student named Yuzu is up ahead, 
in the experimental tower.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.700
Thanks!

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:06.710
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:10.380
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:14.290
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:17.610
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:56.020
The Reborn Phantom Knights

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:06.930
Ruri...

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:09.180
Stay still, Brother.

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:11.430
I'll bring Kaito! I promise!

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:20.670
Kaito, where are you?

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.860
To decide which way to go,

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:27.520
one always asks their own mind...

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.660
Their own mind.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:36.740
Right?

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:53.900
On the other side of this door, Yuzu is...

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:06.520
Yuzu! Yuzu!

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:07.830
Yuzu!

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.560
What is this place?

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:20.340
Yuzu?

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.070
Yuzu!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.580
No, it isn't her.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:28.110
That's... Ruri!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:32.920
Ruri...

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.650
Kurosaki's little sister?

00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:36.720
You're safe, Ruri.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:38.690
Who are you?

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:40.640
I'm Yuya Sakaki.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:42.360
Sakaki?

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:44.140
I'll explain later.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:47.510
Didn't Academia kidnap you?

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:48.600
Y-Yes,

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.940
but my brother came to save me.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:52.570
Kurosaki did?

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:54.410
Kurosaki's at Academia, too?

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:57.930
Yes, but right now, he can't move.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.880
I moved him somewhere 
he couldn't be seen...

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.940
Syun? We need to go save him!

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:06.780
Take me to Kurosaki!

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:07.720
All right.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.420
Enough talk...

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:14.020
Now, why don't you work 
for me, one more time?

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:21.700
What's wrong?

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:22.770
Ruri?

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:27.210
Let's duel!

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:31.590
Ruri?

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:33.790
She's like a different person.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:36.510
Yeah, I've never seen her like this.

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:38.810
Hurry up, Yuya Sakaki!

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.220
I shall turn you into a card.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.210
Turn us into cards?

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:45.550
She's completely under their power.

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:47.690
Yeah, Academia must be behind this.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:49.430
Now, get ready!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.410
Damn.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:51.850
Wait for me, Ruri.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.900
I will return you to normal!

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:03.310
Field Spell Crossover.

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:09.000
Duel!

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.780
I'll go first!

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.230
These are Ute's cards...

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:21.140
Did Ute's feelings for Ruri 
change my deck?

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.550
Let's go, Yuya.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:24.280
Right!

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:29.400
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:06:29.400 --> 00:06:34.070
Ending your turn, only setting cards 
and without summoning monsters?

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:35.370
That first move...

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.840
Remember, Ruri.

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.370
This is wrong.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.930
Duels aren't tools of war!

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:02.410
Duels should bring smiles to everyone... 
to these children's future.

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:03.170
Isn't that right?

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:08.240
"Duels should bring smiles."

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:11.440
That's what you said to me.

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.840
But what about now?

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:14.880
You aren't smiling.

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:18.380
Remember, Ruri!

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.850
Return to your true self!

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:23.820
Who are you?!

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.960
It's me, Ute!

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:30.490
Ute?

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.340
Nonsense!

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:41.610
My turn!

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:44.090
When there are no monsters 
on either player's field,

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:47.910
I can Special Summon Lyrilusc 
— Turquoise Warbler.

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:54.110
When I succeed in Special Summoning it,

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:58.930
I can Special Summon one Level 1 
Lyrilusc from my hand.

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:03.690
I Special Summon Lyrilusc 
— Sapphire Swallow!

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:12.740
Then I overlay Level 1 Turquoise 
Warbler and Sapphire Swallow!

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:23.620
Birds with beautiful wings, assemble on 
the battlefield and shine with glory!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.350
Xyz Summon!

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:31.430
Descend, Rank 1 Lyrilusc — 
Assembled Nightingale!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.530
Assembled Nightingale's effect!

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:39.580
Its attack points increase by 100 
for each of its Overlay Units!

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:44.670
And you can attack directly as many 
times as you have Units, too.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:49.640
You do seem to thoroughly 
know my Lyrilusc deck.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:53.610
Perhaps your claim to be Ute is true.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:55.310
But...

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:59.720
I bet you don't know this card.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:04.760
I activate my spell card Parasite Discharge!

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:09.130
It allows me to Special Summon one 
Fusion Parasite from my deck!

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:15.550
Ruri shouldn't have that 
monster in her deck.

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:16.570
Really?

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:21.040
The surprises aren't over yet.

00:09:21.340 --> 00:09:24.510
When I successfully summon Fusion Parasite,

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:29.180
I can use this card as a component to Fusion 
Summon without a Polymerization card.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:30.400
Ruri is...

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:31.980
...going to Fusion Summon?

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:38.490
I fuse Lyrilusc — Assembled Nightingale 
and Fusion Parasite!

00:09:39.650 --> 00:09:42.990
Songbird who sings through the night,

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:46.730
become one with my internal voice 
and sing out more strongly!

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:48.200
Fusion Summon!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:51.670
Descend, sublime and transcendent 
singer of the night,

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:55.400
Lyrilusc — Independent Nightingale!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:01.880
When Fusion Parasite is used 
as a Fusion component,

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.350
it becomes an equipment card 
for the Fusion Monster.

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:09.090
And when I successfully Fusion 
Summon Independent Nightingale,

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:10.790
its level increases by the

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:14.060
number of Overlay Units 
the Assembled Nightingale,

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:16.220
used as a Fusion component, had.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:22.530
Then, its monster effect increases 
its attack points by 500 per level!

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:28.270
And once per turn, I can deal its level 
times 500 as damage to you!

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:44.600
That parasitic monster...

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:47.130
It must be what's controlling Ruri.

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.290
Yeah, I agree.

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:53.710
Wait for me, Ruri!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.430
I'll beat that monster...

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:57.530
...and return you to your right mind!

00:10:57.530 --> 00:10:58.740
It won't work...

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:08.050
Kurosaki!

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.050
Syun!

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:12.020
Destroying that thing won't save Ruri.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.130
I see a bit of an obstacle has appeared.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.670
I dueled Ruri in the western tower.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:38.260
The moment I defeated Fusion Parasite...

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:40.850
Is that you, Ruri?

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:43.310
Brother, shoot me!

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:46.000
She'd surely returned to her right mind.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.290
Or so I thought.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.330
But...

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:51.190
The result is as you see.

00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:54.160
Then, how do we bring her back to normal?

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:59.130
We must find and defeat the one behind 
the scenes that's controlling her.

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:01.600
In other words...

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:03.850
Enough talk.

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:05.940
My turn is not yet over!

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:08.870
Battle.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:12.980
I attack you directly with 
Independent Nightingale!

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.720
I activate two traps.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:23.540
The Phantom Knights of Lost Vambrace!

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:29.160
This turn, Phantom Knights on my side 
of the field cannot be destroyed.

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:33.630
And the attack points of one of your 
monsters decrease by 600.

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.870
I activated two, so that's 
1200 attack points!

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:43.070
After the effect is activated, 
the traps are Special Summoned

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:45.820
as Normal Monsters, in attack position!

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:54.220
What?

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.160
But you still take damage.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:05.600
Those are Ute's cards!

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:10.600
In addition, by taking battle damage,

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:14.040
I can activate my Quick-Play Spell 
The Phantom Knights' Twin Medals!

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:19.840
I choose two Phantom Knights 
monsters on my side of the field,

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:23.980
and use them as components to Xyz Summon.

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.220
Xyz Summon?

00:13:27.590 --> 00:13:30.980
I overlay my two Level 2...

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:32.440
...Lost Vambraces!

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:46.970
Let the cursed lance of reprisal, which has 
impaled countless warriors, descend!

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:48.670
Xyz Summon!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:53.800
Appear, Rank 2, The Phantom 
Knights of Cursed Javelin!

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:55.110
Yes!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:59.580
Cursed Javelin's effect can 
be used during your turn!

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:05.160
I use one Overlay Unit to negate the 
effect of one monster on the field,

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:07.480
reducing its attack points to 0!

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.860
Using my turn to do whatever you like...

00:14:22.280 --> 00:14:23.470
I end my turn!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.520
Keep Ruri busy!

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:28.960
While you do, I'll find the one controlling her!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:29.960
Okay!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:41.330
Serena!

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:46.460
Where's Yuzu?

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:47.800
Give her back!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.520
Duel me.

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:53.820
If you beat us in a duel,

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.310
I'll do whatever you want.

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.780
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.220
I won't forget those words!

00:15:06.680 --> 00:15:09.920
Now, the true show is about to start.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.540
My turn.

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:20.380
I summon Fusion Parasite from my hand.

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:25.320
That thing again?

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.300
Yeah.

00:15:26.640 --> 00:15:30.940
And I activate Continuous Spell 
Parasite Factory from my hand!

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:36.910
This is...

00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:54.300
I'm borrowing your monster, Ruri.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:57.000
Fine. Do as you wish.

00:15:57.540 --> 00:15:59.700
The turn Parasite Factory is activated,

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:03.740
I can send a monster equipped 
with Fusion Parasite

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:07.400
and one Fusion Parasite on 
my field to the graveyard,

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:09.910
to Fusion Summon!

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.530
Cry of the nightingale, who sings 
in endless darkness,

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:17.770
become one with the voice within, 
and be reborn with new power!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.320
Fusion Summon!

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:26.410
Monarch who nests within the mind, 
Level 8 Parasite Queen!

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:30.800
Yes... Success.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:35.420
The ultimate Parasite Monster, 
which my genius created!

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:38.060
Let it rage to its heart's content!

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:46.680
Parasite Factory lets Parasite 
Queen equip Fusion Parasites

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:48.060
sent to the graveyard.

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:51.690
For each one, its attack 
points increase by 300!

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:01.000
I activate Cursed Javelin's monster effect!

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:06.640
I use one Overlay Unit to negate the 
effect of one monster on the field,

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:08.940
reducing its attack points to 0!

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:12.250
Parasite Factory's effect means

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:15.480
that Parasite Queen is unaffected 
by your monster effects!

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:22.540
So it still has 2400 attack points!

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:23.950
It's coming, Yuya!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:24.920
Battle!

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:29.390
Parasite Queen attacks The Phantom 
Knights of Cursed Javelin!

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:47.080
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:51.450
You were never a match for Academia.

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:55.480
Serena, I thought you cut 
your ties to Academia!

00:17:56.980 --> 00:18:00.460
Remember! Retake your real self!

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.260
I do remember.

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:06.730
But now, that's all in the past.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:08.520
Serena, you...

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:09.610
Look at that.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:15.340
It's cultivating the "bugs" 
that the Doctor created.

00:18:15.770 --> 00:18:16.890
The Doctor?

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:20.040
Academia's greatest scientist.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:22.900
Is he the one controlling you?

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:25.450
One of those bugs

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:28.290
has found a home in here.

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:29.750
What?

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:33.460
Those bugs are controlling the two of them?

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:34.930
And...

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:37.390
Yuzu has one, as well.

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:41.670
What... did you say?

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.540
Yuzu... is...

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:51.290
What's wrong with you?

00:18:51.920 --> 00:18:55.080
The Doctor has let us be reborn.

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:57.020
It's wonderful!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:59.550
You've given up, haven't you?

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:01.300
Yuzu will never return to you—

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.340
Shut up!

00:19:03.480 --> 00:19:04.680
How dare you...

00:19:04.680 --> 00:19:06.520
How dare you hurt Yuzu?!

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.140
Calm down, Yuya.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:14.930
Calm down!

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:20.170
You aren't the only one who 
wants to make them pay.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.640
I do, too!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:43.280
Ute...

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:50.040
Can it be that Yuya Sakaki has 
another personality within him?

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:53.290
My turn!

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:59.140
From my hand, I activate The Phantom 
Knights' Rank-Up-Magic Burial!

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:01.510
I can Special Summon

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:04.580
one Phantom Knights Xyz 
Monster in my graveyard.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:09.550
I Special Summon The Phantom 
Knights of Cursed Javelin!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.430
Ruri...

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:25.390
She's amazing.

00:20:25.390 --> 00:20:26.920
She's my little sister.

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:28.140
I see!

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:33.180
A pleasure to meet you.

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:34.380
I'm Ruri Kurosaki.

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:44.030
And I can use The Phantom 
Knights of Cursed Javelin

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:47.290
as a Fusion component to 
Xyz Summon one monster,

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:50.490
two ranks higher, from my Extra Deck!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:54.650
A Lyrilusc deck? That's a good deck.

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:56.700
Did you devise it yourself?

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:57.470
I did.

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:01.740
I want to fight cheerful, fun duels, 
reminiscent of songbirds,

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:04.280
flying free in the broad sky above!

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.640
From the black darkness,

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:12.520
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:14.890
Rank Up Xyz Change!

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:29.770
Appear, Rank 4 Dark 
Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:40.040
Yuya...

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.140
I hate the man who stole Ruri's smile.

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:46.420
Yeah, so do I.

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:49.470
The enemy we need to defeat is the Doctor!

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:51.090
And then, without doubt,

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:52.250
Ruri,

00:21:52.250 --> 00:21:53.340
Serena,

00:21:53.340 --> 00:21:54.290
and Yuzu...

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:55.560
...will return to us!

00:21:57.280 --> 00:22:00.030
Then, beat them and come after me.

00:22:00.400 --> 00:22:02.630
Do it, if you can!

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:49.870
Are you the Doctor?

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:51.270
Where is Yuzu?

00:23:52.840 --> 00:23:56.060
Sorry, but you won't ever see her...

00:23:56.060 --> 00:23:59.230
Because you're going to die there.

00:23:59.230 --> 00:24:03.120
No matter how many you send, 
bugs are no more than bugs!

00:24:03.650 --> 00:24:05.610
Dragon with different-colored eyes!

00:24:05.610 --> 00:24:07.720
Be reborn from deepest darkness,

00:24:07.720 --> 00:24:11.160
and scorch the whole world 
with your flames of anger!

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:15.290
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Dragon of Raging Fire.

00:24:15.290 --> 00:24:17.290
The fun is only getting started!
